                        2224 --2364: * Function name: D_FLS_SetUPGPProtect_ram
                        2225 --2365: * Description  : Enable/Disable the UPGP1 and UPGP2 protection
                        2226 --2366: * Arguments    : flag1  : Enable(D_FLS_UPGP_ON) / Disable(D_FLS_UPGP_OFF)
                        2227 --2367: *                flag2  : Enable(D_FLS_UPGP_ON) / Disable(D_FLS_UPGP_OFF)
