                        3648 --288: * Function Name : d_FLS_Handler_ram
                        3649 --289: * Description   : Proceed with this FACI command operation by FLS and confirm the completion.
                        3650 --290: * Arguments     : fpsys
                        3651 --291: *                  FACI number
